==Trivia==
===Personal===
* He is a long time teammate of [[JW]] - they played on the same team together for a total of 5 years, 235 days (January 29th 2013 - September 21st 2018) before '''flusha''' was benched from [[Fnatic]] and later acquired by [[Cloud9]]. Their tenure continued when '''flusha''' rejoined [[Fnatic]] on September 16, 2019, followed by their cooperation in [[EYEBALLERS]] starting in 2022.
* He donated some of his own prize money from [[IOS Pantamera]] to [[KaBuM!_e-Sports|Kabum e-Sports]], which granted them an opportunity to qualify for [[ESL/One/2015/Katowice|ESL One: Katowice 2015]]. This would inevitably lead to the [[FalleN]]-led squad to make an impression on the scene to find better sponsors, and later using that golden opportunity to make it to the top, winning two [[Majors|Valve Majors]] in the following year. <ref>{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/flusha/status/564557021513793538|title=just donated a part of my Pantamera winnings to the @KaBuMESports team so they can go to poland and try to qualify to the major in katowice!|date=2015-02-09|author='''flusha'''}}</ref>

